    {
      "text": "God caused a deep sleep to fall upon Adam, Gen. 2:21 (Moses 3:21; Abr. 5:15). deep sleep fell upon Abram, Gen. 15:12. Samuel was laid down to sleep, 1 Sam. 3:3. he that keepeth Israel shall neither slumber nor sleep, Ps. 121:4. to sit up late … for so he giveth his beloved sleep, Ps. 127:2. How long wilt thou sleep, O sluggard, Prov. 6:9. Love not sleep, lest thou come to poverty, Prov. 20:13. Yet a little sleep, a little slumber, Prov. 24:33. sleep of a labouring man is sweet, Eccl. 5:12. poured out upon you the spirit of deep sleep, Isa. 29:10 (2 Ne. 27:5). sleep a perpetual sleep, and not wake, Jer. 51:39 (51:57). them that sleep in the dust of the earth shall awake, Dan. 12:2.",
